#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:339
msgid "TRT-LLM"
msgstr "TRT-LLM"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:342
msgid ""
"The TRT-LLM backend uses the Python LLM API inside the model process. It "
"requires Linux, NVIDIA CUDA GPUs and ``tensorrt-llm==1.2.1``. Model support "
"follows the text architectures implemented by that version, including "
"Qwen2/2.5, Qwen3 (dense, MoE and Next), Llama, Mistral/Mixtral, Gemma3, "
"Phi3, DeepSeek, GLM MoE, MiniMax M2, GPT-OSS, Hunyuan, EXAONE, Nemotron, "
"SeedOSS and Starcoder2. Fine-tuned and custom models use the same "
"architecture matching."
msgstr ""
"TRT-LLM 后端在模型进程内使用 Python LLM API，需要 Linux、NVIDIA CUDA GPU 和 ``tensorrt-"
"llm==1.2.1``。模型支持按该版本实现的文本架构匹配，包括 Qwen2/2.5, Qwen3 (dense, MoE, Next), "
"Llama, Mistral/Mixtral, Gemma3, Phi3, DeepSeek, GLM MoE, MiniMax M2, GPT-"
"OSS, Hunyuan, EXAONE, Nemotron, SeedOSS, Starcoder2。微调模型和自定义模型使用相同的架构匹配规则。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:344
msgid ""
"The example launches two independent replicas with a shared 512 MiB Xavier "
"CPU cache. Each replica uses one GPU. Install TRT-LLM in a compatible CUDA "
"environment and set ``enable_virtual_env=False``, or use a per-model virtual"
" environment with matching dependencies. Each replica currently requires "
"TP=PP=CP=1, with TRT's worker running directly in the Xinference model "
"process. Qwen3 weights and KV pages use BF16."
msgstr ""
"此示例启动两个独立副本，共享 512 MiB 的 Xavier CPU 缓存。每个副本使用一张 GPU。在兼容的 CUDA 环境中安装 TRT-LLM "
"并设置 ``enable_virtual_env=False``，或使用依赖匹配的按模型虚拟环境。 当前每个副本要求 TP=PP=CP=1，TRT "
"worker 直接运行在 Xinference 模型进程内。Qwen3 权重和 KV 页使用 BF16。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:366
msgid ""
"Xavier publishes complete 64-token BF16 KV pages and restores matching "
"prefixes in another replica through actor RPC. Partial pages and the final "
"prompt token are computed locally. The shared cache uses bounded storage and"
" LRU eviction; transfers currently use synchronous CPU staging."
msgstr ""
"Xavier 发布完整的 64-token BF16 KV 页，通过 actor RPC 在另一副本中恢复匹配的前缀。不完整的页和提示词的最后一个 "
"token 在本地计算。共享缓存具有容量上限并采用 LRU 淘汰；当前传输使用同步 CPU 暂存。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:370
msgid ""
"The shared cache actor reports ``imported_pages`` after copies into the "
"destination KV pool complete. Use this counter to verify cross-instance "
"imports. Measure latency and throughput for your workload; transfer costs "
"can exceed the saved prefill computation."
msgstr ""
"共享缓存 actor 在数据复制到目标 KV 池完成后记录 "
"``imported_pages``。使用此计数器验证跨实例导入。请针对实际负载测量延迟和吞吐量；传输开销可能超过节省的 prefill 计算成本。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:373
msgid ""
"For same-engine P/D, set explicit prefill/decode roles in ``replica_config``"
" as described in :ref:`user_guide_pd_separation`. The default "
"``transfer_backend_type=\"xavier\"`` uses NIXL to transfer KV pages directly"
" between GPUs. Set ``transfer_backend_type=\"nixl\"`` for TRT's native "
"context/generation protocol and NIXL transport; do not also set "
"``enable_xavier=True``. Both paths support generation, chat, streaming and "
"cancellation through the same Xinference API."
msgstr ""
"同引擎 P/D 需要在 ``replica_config`` 中显式设置 prefill/decode 角色，参见 "
":ref:`user_guide_pd_separation`。默认的 ``transfer_backend_type=\"xavier\"`` 使用 "
"NIXL 在 GPU 之间直接传输 KV 页。设置 ``transfer_backend_type=\"nixl\"`` 可使用 TRT 原生 "
"context/generation 协议和 NIXL 传输；不要同时设置 ``enable_xavier=True``。两条路径均通过相同的 "
"Xinference API 支持生成、聊天、流式响应和取消。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:14
msgid ""
"For speculative decoding methods and launch options, see "
":ref:`speculative_decoding`."
msgstr "投机解码的方法和启动选项请参见 :ref:`speculative_decoding`。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:263
msgid ""
"Shared caching and same-engine P/D require TP=PP=CP=1, BF16 weights and KV, "
"and disabled chunked prefill and overlap scheduling. Quantization, hybrid "
"attention, multimodal input, LoRA, speculative decoding and ``cache_salt`` "
"are not supported in these configurations. Ordinary replicas support "
":ref:`speculative_decoding` with NGram or Draft/Target. For supported cross-"
"engine P/D combinations, see :ref:`user_guide_pd_separation`."
msgstr ""
"共享缓存和同引擎 P/D 要求 TP=PP=CP=1、BF16 权重与 "
"KV，并禁用分块预填充和重叠调度。这些配置不支持量化、混合注意力、多模态输入、LoRA、投机解码和 ``cache_salt``。普通副本支持 "
"NGram 或 Draft/Target :ref:`speculative_decoding`。支持的跨引擎 P/D 组合请参见 "
":ref:`user_guide_pd_separation`。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:239
msgid ""
"Ordinary replicas accept ``pytorch``, ``fp8`` and ``fp4`` checkpoints, with "
"quantization inferred from the checkpoint configuration. This includes "
"compatible ModelOpt exports and native FP8 block-scaled or MXFP4 weights. "
"Use ModelOpt exports for AWQ; generic Hugging Face AWQ/GPTQ, bitsandbytes, "
"GGUF and MLX checkpoint formats are not supported by this PyTorch loader. "
"TRT validates the checkpoint recipe and GPU kernel requirements at startup. "
"Ordinary replicas accept ``dtype=\"auto\"``, ``\"float16\"`` or "
"``\"bfloat16\"``; TP=PP=CP=1 still applies. Shared caching and P/D have the "
"additional constraints below."
msgstr ""
"普通副本接受 ``pytorch``、``fp8`` 和 ``fp4`` 权重，量化方式从权重配置中读取，包括兼容的 ModelOpt 导出权重和原生 "
"FP8 块缩放或 MXFP4 权重。AWQ 请使用 ModelOpt 导出；此 PyTorch 加载器不支持通用 Hugging Face "
"AWQ/GPTQ、bitsandbytes、GGUF 和 MLX 权重格式。TRT 在启动时检查量化方案和 GPU 内核要求。普通副本接受 "
"``dtype=\"auto\"``、``\"float16\"`` 或 ``\"bfloat16\"``，仍要求 TP=PP=CP=1。共享缓存和 "
"P/D 还需满足下文的额外约束。"
